    <description>
      <title>Charming</title>
      <body>🏡 Welcome to 135 Ocean Street in Lynn! 

This comfortable Third Floor (Elevator) studio offers approximately 350 sq. ft. of living space with a practical layout and convenient features. 

Features: Studio, 1 full bathroom, hardwood and tile floors, heating, granite countertops, pantry, range, refrigerator, tub/shower, and cable-ready setup. The unit also offers views and a comfortable kitchen area. 

Conveniently located in Lynn, with access to public transportation, restaurants, shopping, markets, and local amenities. Cats are allowed. Section 8 is welcome! 

Lease Details &amp; Requirements: 
• Rent: $1,650.00 /month 
• First Month Rent: $1,650.00 
• No Last Month Rent 
• Security Deposit: $1,650.00 
• Broker fee One Full Month Rent 
• No application fee  
• Proof of income required 
• Credit and background screening (A fee could apply) 
• Cat Friendly 
• No smoking 
• Parking available for $50.00/month. 
  
Utilities: 
• Heat  
• Cold and Hot Water 
 
Tenant Responsible For: 
• Cooking Gas 
• Electricity 
 
Appliances Included: 
• Refrigerator 
• Gas stove  
  
Key Features: 
• Studio | 1 bathroom 
• Harwood flooring throughout 
• Cabinetry 
• In-building laundry 
• Professionally managed building 
  
Additional Features: 
• Natural lighting 
• Secure building 
  
 
Location Highlights: 
 
Located in Lynn’s Diamond District, a coastal residential neighborhood.  
Walking distance to Lynn Beach, King’s Beach, and Red Rock Park, with nearby walking and biking trails.  
Approximately 0.8 miles to Swampscott Commuter Rail Station and 1.4 miles to Lynn Interim Station.  
Approximately 0.2 miles from an MBTA bus stop.  
Close to restaurants, cafes, grocery stores, and everyday shopping.  
Convenient access to Lynn Shore Drive and major North Shore destinations.  
About 5.8 miles from Wonderland Station and approximately 10 miles from Boston Logan International Airport. 
 
Contact us for more information or to schedule a viewing 📞</body>
